-- The module `export-imported-hop.l4` imports. It has no error of its own,
-- but it imports `export-imported-unchecked-lib.l4`, which does not
-- type-check, so `l4 check` refuses it (import/module-has-errors) and `l4 run`
-- evaluates nothing in it. Its `clean` is therefore not copied either.
IMPORT `export-imported-unchecked-lib`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`clean` MEANS 5
